o.desc:
Where to use the adFrame Starter?
Trade shows: If you frequently participate in trade shows, you need a practical, mobile, and multifunctional product. The adFrame Starter meets all these requirements.
In-store advertising: This indoor frame is perfect for displaying advertisements along the walls of shops or commercial spaces. The double-sided version, placed in high-traffic areas, captures the attention of customers coming from both directions.
Conferences and business presentations: The adFrame Starter can also be used as a professional backdrop for presentations, speeches, and even online meetings.
adFrame Starter – Advantages
Intuitive assemblyThe adFrame Starter requires no tools for assembly. Thanks to special locks, the components connect intuitively, saving time during the preparation of trade show stands, events, or presentations.
Replaceable printsThe option to replace prints allows you to adapt the product to your current advertising message. If you already own a frame, simply order new prints tailored to the dimensions of the structure. The new graphic materials can be easily mounted on the previously purchased frame. This versatility and durability make the adFrame Starter an attractive alternative to the traditional roll up banner.
MobilityWith an aluminum frame 6 cm thick, the adFrame Starter is lightweight and easy to transport. Available in two sizes, the product comes with a convenient carrying bag that simplifies transportation.
Technical details:


Free-standing system;


Non-illuminated;


Ultra-light aluminum structure;


6 cm thick frame;


Locks for tool-free assembly;


Fabric print with rubber edging;


Option for print replacement;


Carrying bag included.


Dimensions and weight:


Width: 100 cm;


Height: 200/250 cm;


Weight: 9/11 kg.

